{"articleNo":"2995","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2995&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 전기 대학원별 학위논문심사 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.10.24","hit":"10153","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 전기 대학원(일반,산업,교육및컨설팅) 학위논문심사신청서류(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2995&attachNo=1560"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#99ffff\" height=\"107\" valign=\"middle\" bordercolor=\"#330000\" width=\"555\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"><strong>2011학년도 전기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)<br>학위논문심사 신청&nbsp;안내</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 제출대상자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012년 2월 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 학위수여예정자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 대학원 박사과정 학위수여예정자 학위논문 학술지 게재 실적제출 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">\n</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ￭ 제출논문 조건 :&nbsp;재학 중 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에 1편 이상&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp; ￭ 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부. </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ￭ 게재 예정인 경우 : 게재(예정)증명서 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;(게재예정일자가 논문심사완료일[2011.12.16(금)]이전 일것</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffcc99\">2011. 10. 31(월) ~ 11. 03(목)[4일간]</font></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 논문심사료 납부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffcc99\">2011. 10. 31(월) ~ 11. 03(목)[4일간]</font></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 논문심사료 : 박사과정 300,000원, 석사과정 100,000원</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부방법 : 계좌입금(이름 또는 본인의 학번)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 해당 대학원 계좌에 넣으셔야 합니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 입금 확인 후 입금 후 익일 13시 이후 문의 바랍니다.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 논문심사 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffcc99\">2011. 10. 31(월) ~ 11. 03(목)[4일간]</font></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 논문심사신청서 1부. (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 지도교수추천서 1부. (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 심사용 논문(석사 : 3부, 박사 : 5부) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 논문심사료 납입영수증 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (명세표 또는 통장 사본 및 확인증)-입금 증빙할만한 서류</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">⑤ 학위논문 연구윤리 준수 확인서 1부.(첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다. 제출장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 학위논문 심사기간 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff\"> <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2011. </strong></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff\"><strong>11. 16(수) ~ 12. 16(금)<br></strong></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 논문발표 등 학과별 심사일정은 학과(전공)별 기준에 따름&nbsp;<br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6. 학위논문 원문파일 제출 :<strong> </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff\"><strong>2011. 12. 27(화) ~ 2011. 12. 30(금)[4일간]</strong></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">7. 학위논문 완성본 제출 (제출양식 등 세부사항은 추후 공고) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 완성논문 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff\"><strong>2012. 01. 09(월) ~&nbsp; 01. 12(목)[4일간]</strong></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2011.&nbsp;10.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
